{"query": "John 3:16\u201317", "canonical": "John 3:16\u201317", "parsed": [[43003016, 43003017]], "passage_meta": [{"canonical": "John 3:16\u201317", "chapter_start": [43003001, 43003036], "chapter_end": [43003001, 43003036], "prev_verse": 43003015, "next_verse": 43003018, "prev_chapter": [43002001, 43002025], "next_chapter": [43004001, 43004054]}], "passages": ["<h2 class=\"extra_text\">John 3:16\u201317 <small class=\"audio extra_text\">(<a class=\"mp3link\" href=\"https://audio.esv.org/david-cochran-heath/mq/43003016-43003017.mp3\" title=\"John 3:16\u201317\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">Listen</a>)</small></h2>\n<h3 id=\"p43003016_01-1\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_01\" rel=\"v43003016\"></a>For God So Loved the World</h3>\n<p id=\"p43003016_07-1\"><b class=\"verse-num woc\" id=\"v43003016-1\">16&nbsp;</b><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_07\" rel=\"v43003016\"></a><span class=\"woc\">\u201cFor <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Romans 5:8; Ephesians 2:4; 2 Thessalonians 2:16; 1 John 3:1; 1 John 4:9\u201310/\" title=\"Rom. 5:8; Eph. 2:4; 2 Thess. 2:16; 1 John 3:1; 4:9, 10\">h</a></sup>God so loved <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"John 1:29/\" title=\"See ch. 1:29\">i</a></sup>the world,<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f1-1\" id=\"fb1-1\" title=\"&lt;note class=&quot;alternative&quot;&gt;Or &lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;catch-word&quot;&gt;For&lt;/span&gt; this is how God loved the world&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/note&gt;\">1</a></sup> <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Romans 8:32/\" title=\"Rom. 8:32\">j</a></sup>that he gave his only Son, that whoever believes in him should not <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"John 10:28/\" title=\"ch. 10:28\">k</a></sup>perish but have eternal life.</span> <b class=\"verse-num woc\" id=\"v43003017-1\">17&nbsp;</b><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_07\" rel=\"v43003017\"></a><span class=\"woc\">For <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"John 5:36; John 5:38; John 6:29; John 6:57; John 7:29; John 8:42; John 10:36; John 11:42; John 17:3; John 20:21; Romans 8:3; 1 John 4:9\u201310; 1 John 4:14/\" title=\"ch. 5:36, 38; 6:29, 57; 7:29; 8:42; 10:36; 11:42; 17:3; 20:21; Rom. 8:3; 1 John 4:9, 10, 14\">l</a></sup>God did not send his Son into the world <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"John 5:45; John 8:15; John 12:47/\" title=\"ch. 5:45; 8:15; 12:47\">m</a></sup>to condemn the world, but in order that the world might be saved through him.</span></p>\n<div class=\"footnotes extra_text\">\n<h3>Footnotes</h3>\n<p><span class=\"footnote\"><a href=\"#fb1-1\" id=\"f1-1\">[1]</a></span> <span class=\"footnote-ref\">3:16</span> <note class=\"alternative\">Or <i><span class=\"catch-word\">For</span> this is how God loved the world</i></note>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>(<a href=\"http://www.esv.org\" class=\"copyright\">ESV</a>)</p>"]}